Third-party software and models used by this project
-----------------------------------------------------

vllm-project/speculators (https://github.com/vllm-project/speculators)
  Apache License 2.0. Installed as a dependency at revision
  824125a36600b5af8fdd1b18286da51ed60f60a8 (scripts/install_speculators.sh); not
  vendored. Provides DFlash2DraftModel, the DFlash/DFlash2 losses, metrics and
  attention masks this trainer builds on. Its DFlash2 model definitions carry
  the notice "MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Z Lab" (from
  https://github.com/z-lab/dflash).

enntity_drafter/fastpath.py and enntity_drafter/objectives.py re-implement
  (packed attention mask) or re-compose (light loss path) upstream Speculators
  functions; their behaviour is tested against the upstream functions.

GLM-5.3-Flash (https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash) and
nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4)
  MIT License. The target model. Its embedding, final norm and lm_head are
  read at training time from the user's own copy and are never exported or
  redistributed; its tokenizer and chat template are read from that copy.

Atlas inference engine (https://github.com/Enntity/atlas)
  AGPL-3.0-only. Used as a separate server for hidden-state capture and
  evaluation; no engine code is included here.

RigMark (https://github.com/alexellis/rigmark)
  MIT License. Benchmark used for some results in docs/results.md; not included.

Not used
--------

incoai/GLM-5.3-Flash-DFlash2 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0): no weights, configuration,
tokenizer files, outputs or text from it are used or included. Comparisons in
docs/results.md are measurements of that drafter served by Atlas.
